        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo MST-161-630 Stainless Steel Mortise Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStandard ANSI Mortise Strike Plate. Normally used on commercial metal frame doors for <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-mortise-lock-sets-pdq-mr-pfsf\"><b>Mortise Locks</b></a>. Package includes stainless steel mortise strike plate with installation screws for use on either wood or metal doors and frames. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-MST-161-630_size.gif?v=1704354617\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ANSI Stainless Steel Mortise Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo MST-161-630 Mortise Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width to Lip: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Total Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #12-24 Flat Head Combo Screws (for wood or metal doors)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MST-161-630.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo MST-161-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
